<%# Etapa 2.3d2 (decided 19/10/2026): what the pedido waits for — its stock
    out passed what came in, oldest outs covered first. Never blocks; an
    entry clears it. A cliente final sees the meters of his own fabric only
    (AguardandoMaterialHelper). %>
<% if (aguardando = aguardando_do_pedido(pedido)) %>
  <p class="pedido-aguardando" data-resumo="aguardando" role="status"><strong>Aguardando:</strong> <%= aguardando %></p>
<% end %>
<%# Dublagem 5b2b (Q4b): a cola short is a warning, never a wait. %>
<% if (aviso = aviso_do_pedido(pedido)) %>
  <p class="pedido-aviso-material" data-resumo="aviso-material" role="note"><strong>Falta no estoque:</strong> <%= aviso %></p>
<% end %>
